sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Agency user
    participant P as Agency panel
    participant R as Core: Request module
    participant Y as Yaghut
    participant DB as Oracle
    participant W as Outbox worker
    participant N as SMS Notifier
    U->>P: national code, branch, amount, expiry date, companions
    P->>R: POST /api/agency/requests
    Note over R: @IranianNationalCode check, branch must be open
    R->>DB: lock agency row (FOR UPDATE)
    alt same agency + national code registered within 10 s
        R-->>P: 409 a similar request was registered moments ago
    end
    R->>Y: POST /customerDetailInfo {code} with the agency user's JSESSIONID
    alt customer not found, or not an ACTUAL person
        Y-->>R: fault
        R-->>P: 400 customer not found in the bank
    else Yaghut session invalid
        Y-->>R: fault
        R-->>P: 401 Yaghut session expired, log in again
    end
    Y-->>R: customer details incl. mobile
    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        Note over R,DB: one transaction
        R->>DB: lock tracking_counter row (branch + agency + day), next value
        R->>DB: insert customer snapshot (plain text), request REGISTERED_AT_AGENCY, companions
        R->>DB: insert outbox row SMS 1 (completion link), audit row
    end
    R-->>P: 201 tracking code (17 to 19 digits)
    W->>DB: pick pending outbox rows
    W->>N: POST /api/v1/sms/SendSimpleSms {numbers 0989..., message}
    N-->>W: retval smsId
    W->>DB: mark SENT, store smsId
